 <NOTE N="1" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0724" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0724D"></COL> In marg. edit. Rom.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>prwðta.</FOREIGN>   <ED>LAT.</ED></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>provbata dokouðsi meún eiønai ejx hJmwðn, ajll1 oujk eijsiún ejx
hJmwðn× eij gaúr høsan ejx hJmwðn, memenhvkesan aÞn meq1 hJmwðn.
4Otan deú</FOREIGN>  
 <HI REND=BOLD>753</HI>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek> thún eJautwðn ajpemevswsi dussevbeian, toún
ejn aujtoiðû ajporjrJhvxanteû dovlon, ejpilabovmenoi twðn ajsqenestevrwn, kaiú taú aijsqhthvria proúû taú qeiða lovgia ejcovntwn
ajguvmnasta, suún eJautoiðû wjqouðsin aujtouúû eijû ajpwvleian,
streblouðnteû kaiú skwúptonteû taúû twðn patevrwn didaskalivaû,
wJû kaiú taúû</FOREIGN>  
 <NOTE N="2" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0724" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0724D"></COL> Annotatur in editis.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Forte,</HI>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>aJgivaû.</FOREIGN>   <ED>HARD.</ED></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>loipaúû grafaúû, proúû thún ijdivan ajpwvleian
eJautwðn× ouÝû deið proginwvskontaû fulavttesqai, iåna
