wJseiú oæfewû× iúoúû ajspivdwn uJpoú taú ceivlh aujtwðn,» periú touvtwn
 <COL N="0724C"></COL> ajnakevkragen oJ profhvthû.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0724"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Toiouðtoû hJmiðn tanuðn ajnapevfantai Eujtichúû, oJ pavlai
presbuvteroû kaiú ajrcimandrivthû× oÝû meún taú hJmevtera
