Kuvrion hJmwðn 1Ihsouðn Cristoún mhú deiðn</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="2" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0726" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0726D"></COL> In marg. edit. Rom.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>oJmologeiðn.</FOREIGN>  Quae vox quidem
post  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>deiðn</FOREIGN>  necessario supplenda.</NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejk duvo fuvsewn
metaú thún ejnanqrwvphsin, ejn miaðé uJpostavsei, kaiú ejn eJniú
proswvpwé par1 hJmwðn gnwrizovmenon, mhvte mhún thún savrka
