proslhfqeiðsan</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="3" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0726" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0726D"></COL> Duas has voces,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kaiú eJnwqeiðsan,</FOREIGN>  ex iis codd. Ven.
supplevimus.</NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kaiú eJnwqeiðsan twðé Qewé Lovgwðé kaq1 uJpovstasin×
 <COL N="0726B"></COL> ajll1 eæfaske, thún meún tekouðsan aujtoún Parqevnon
 <COL N="0728A"></COL> kataú savrka, oJmoouvsion hJmiðn eiønai, aujtoún deú toún Kuvrion
mhú eijlhfevnai ejx aujthðû savrka hJmiðn oJmoouvsion× ajllaú toú
touð Kurivou swðma mhú eiønai meún swðma ajnqrwvpou, ajnqrwvpinon
deú swðma toú ejk thðû Parqevnou× pavsaiû taiðû ejkqevsesi
twðn aJgivwn Patevrwn ejnantiouvmenoû.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0728"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>1All1 iåna mhú pavnta katalevgwn,  <HI REND=BOLD>757</HI>  mhðkoû ejmpoihvsw
twðé gravmmati, pavlai thún ejp1 aujtwðé gegenhmevnhn praðxin
ajpesteivlamen thðé shðé oJsiovthti, ejn hßé kaiú thðû iJerwsuvnhû
aujtoún, wJû ejpiú toiouvtoiû aJlovnta, ejgumnwvsamen, kaiú touð
