 <NOTE N="2" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0734" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0734D"></COL> Iidem mss.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>uJpolhvyewû.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejpilhvyewû, prevpei gaúr ejpiú twðn toiouvtwn aijtiwðn touvtou
