eiønai</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="3" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0734" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0734D"></COL> Ita laudati codices; sicque scripsisse interpretem
haud dubitamus; aut certe  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejmfrontivdaû</FOREIGN>  ut uno verbo
