ut videre est in  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>eæmponoû, eænspodoû,</FOREIGN>  aliisque ejusmodi.
In vulgatis,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejn frontivdi.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek> ejmfrontivdaû, plhrevstata kaiú thlaugevstata suvmpanta
hJmiðn, oåper hædh poihðsai wæfeile, dhlwðsai spoudavsei×
iåna mhú metaxuú thðû didaskalivaû twðn mevrwn, ajmfibolivaé
