aiJ diatupwvseiû twðn proskunhtwðn patevrwn,</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="4" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0734" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0734D"></COL> Addidimus articulum  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>aiJ</FOREIGN>  ex mss. Venetis.</NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>aiJ qeovqen
 <COL N="0736A"></COL> thún ijscuún eæcousai, kaiú eijû thún teleiovthta thðû pivstewû
