 <COL N="0760A"></COL> <NOTE N="1" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0760" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0760B"></COL> Antea erat  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ouæte metagenevsteroû,</FOREIGN>  quod non cuique
