proúû hJmaðû ajpostalevnti</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="6" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0784" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0784C"></COL> In marg. edit. Rom.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>aÝn touðto,</FOREIGN>  ex Lat</NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kaiú touðto eJautwð proúû toú ajxiwqhðnai
