levgonti twé Kurivwé.</FOREIGN>  In vulg.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>oåte gaúr levgonti.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>thún eJautouð plavnhn ejpignoivh, kaiú
