 <COL N="0800A"></COL> wJû</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="1" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0800" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0800C"></COL> Ita legere maluimus cum ms. Ven., quam cum
