Toutevstin, wåste ejn prwvtoiû thðû fqoropoiouð</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="5" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0800" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0800D"></COL> In marg. edit. Rom.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>plavnhû katadikasqeivshû,
