aujtouð katadikasqeivshû,</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="6" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0800" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0800D"></COL> Ms. Ven.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>eijq1 ouåtwû</FOREIGN> ; melius quidem, si etiam
