 <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>wn</FOREIGN>  pro  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ou</FOREIGN>  levissima duarum litterarum mutatione
sanatur.</NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>eujlabestavtou ejpiskovpou, kaiú touð pivstotavtou
