 <HI REND=BOLD>905</HI>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>qeovthtoû,</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="3" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0824" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0824D"></COL> Editores Romani in margine,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kaiú thðû ajlhqouðû ejn
