ejpiskovpwn ajpoú paswðn twðn ajnatolikwðn ejparciwðn</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="4" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0824" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0824D"></COL> Ita codd. Graec. Vat. 1455 et Ottob. 29. Erat in
vulgatis,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>oiæ tineû uåbreiû.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>wßn
eiæ tineû uåbreiû kataú thn oJdoún thðû ajlhqeivaû wæflhsan, swthriwvdesi
