 <COL N="0828B"></COL> pivstewû, hJn tina qeovqen,</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="3" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0828" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0828C"></COL> Ms. Ven.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejmpneusqeiðsan hÝn kaiv.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejmpneusqeiðsan kaiú parelavbomen,
