håtiû paðsan ajsevbeian</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="3" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0830" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0830D"></COL> Ms. Ven. et in marg. edit. Rom.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>uJpobavllei.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>uJperbavllei, ejxaleifqeivh. 1All1
 <COL N="0830B"></COL> ejpeidhú hJ diabolikhú kakourgiva, leptomerwðû ajpatwðsa
touúû ajfelestevrouû, twðé trovpwé touvtwé thún ajpaideusivan
ejpiú oJmoiwvmati thðû eujsebeivaû ajpataðén ejpeceivrhsen, iåna</FOREIGN>  
