ejavn.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>hJ sklhrotavth ajpovfasiû, ejaún gnwvmaiû kreivttosin ejpakolouqhvswsin, ajpoú
thðû eJnovthtoû thðû ejkklhsivaû mhdamwðû ajpostwðsin. 4Opwû
 <COL N="0832B"></COL> gaúr metaú thún eækklhton touðto ajnagkaivwû aijtouðmen, twðn
