 <COL N="0838B"></COL> sunhvlasen eijû aællhn suvnodon, ajpeilaiðû kaiú ejpiboulaiðû
proskalouvmenoû× proúû tov me, oåper ajpevstw, hÞ ejx ajpathû</FOREIGN>  
