ejkeiðqen ajnecwvroun, diaú ajgnwvstwn kaiú ajnodeuvtwn
tovpwn eijû thún 2Rwvmhn ajphðlqon× twðé eujlabestavtw
Pavpaaé pavntwn twðn ejn 1Efevswé pepragmevnwn iJkanwðû memhvnutai</FOREIGN>  
 <COL N="0838C"></COL> [Forte  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>iJkanoúû mhnutthúû]. 5On hJ uJmetevra proskunhthú
filanqrwpiva manqanevtw, metaú pavshû thðû dutikhðû (sunovdou)
ajpodokimavsai pavnta taú ejn 1Efevswé kataú twðn kanov
 <COL N="0840A"></COL> nwn diaú qoruvbou kaiú mivsouû biwtikouð ajpoú Dioskovrou
touð ejpiskovpou genovmena, kaiú mhdeniú lovgwé tauðta uJpodecqhðnai
