Ven.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>makarivwé te.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>makarivwé ajpostwvlwé Pevtrwé aætrwton kaiú ejn toiðû hJmetevroiû crovnoiû diafulavttein× iæna oJ makariwvtatoû ejpiskopoû
