eåneka thðû</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="2" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0860" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0860D"></COL> In marg. edit. Rom.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>perikuyavshû.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ajnakuyavshû filoneikivaû periú thðû pivstewû.</FOREIGN>  
 <COL N="0860B"></COL> <NOTE N="3" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0860" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0860D"></COL> In marg. edit. Rom.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>touvtwé</FOREIGN>   <ED>L.</ED></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Touðto ouøn aijtouðnti, kaiú ejneucomevnwé thún koinhún swthrivan 
hJmwðn, ejpineuðsai  <HI REND=BOLD>963</HI>  oujk hjrnhsavmhn toú proúû thún
shún hJmerovthta thún ejmhún aiæthsin oijkeiwðsai× iåna oJ prolecqeiúû ijereuúû, sunacqevntwn ejk pavshû thðû oijkoumevnhû
kag twðn loipwðn iJerevwn, ejntoúû thðû 1Italivaû, pantoúû prokrivmatoû
ajpokinhqevntoû, ejx uJparchðû thún strefomevnhn
aijtivan pefrontismevnhé dokimasivaé diagnouúû, ejxoivshé thún
ajpovfasin, hÝn hJ pivstiû, kaiú oJ thðû ajlhqouðû qeiovthtoû lovgoû ajpaiteið. Ouj gaúr ojfeivlei ejn toiðû hJmetevroiû kairoiðû
kainovthû qrhskeivaû eijsavgesqai qoruvbwé propeteivaû, aJsaleuvtou
