 <COL N="0862A"></COL> <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>te oJmoivwû toún korufaiðon twðn ajpostovlwn, wßé kaiú
eænagcoû</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="1" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0862" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0862D"></COL> Ms. Ven.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>proseivh,</FOREIGN>  atque ita etiam in marg. edit.</NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>proseivhmen, mavrtura sullabovmenoû, periestoicismevnoû
te plhvqei ejpiskovpwn, ouåû tinaû ajpoú ajnariqmhvtwn
