te twðn stratiwtwðn parousivaé, kaiú twðé fuvbwé kataplhvttwn
toún ejpivskopon thðû</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="2" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0862" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0862D"></COL> Ms. Ven.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Kwnstantinopolitwðn.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Kwnstantinoupovlewû Flauianoún, diaú
 <COL N="0862B"></COL> toú livbellon steiðlai proúû toún ajpostolikoún qrovnon, kaiú
proúû pavntaû touúû ejpiskovpouû twðn merwðn touvtwn, diaú
twðn ajpostalevntwn ejn thðé sunovdwé parav touð eujlabestavtou
