sunovdou eijqivsqhsan sunievnai, devspota</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="3" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0862" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0862D"></COL> In marg. edit. Rom.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>iæswû, aJgiwvtate.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>aJgnovtate
uiJeú basileuð proskunhtev. Touvtou cavrin hJ shú hJmerovthû
