mevnontoû ejn paðsi Flauianouð,</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="4" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0862" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0862D"></COL> Legendum,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>eijû thún suvnodon.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejn thðé sunovdwé touð
ajpostolikouð qrovnou hJ divkh parapemfqeivh <HI REND=BOLD>967</HI>  ejn wßé
