thún ejpiskophún thðû ajrcierwsuvnhû ejkovsmhse dhladhv×
 <COL N="0862C"></COL> oJpovte preúpei hJmaðû tauvthé thðé megivsthé povlei, hå tiû
devspoina paswðn uJpavrcei twðn</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="5" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0862" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0862D"></COL> In marg. edit. Rom.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>iæs. gaiwðn.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>gewðn, ejn paðsi toú sevbaû
