tovpwn thún proskuvnhsin, kaiú thðû</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="4" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0864" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0864D"></COL> In marg. edit. Rom.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>hJmetevraû.</FOREIGN>   <ED>L.</ED></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>uJmetevraû hJmerovthtoû
 <COL N="0864B"></COL> thún swthrivan. 4Wste proúû thún shún filanqrwpivan
