devspota</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="5" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0864" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0864D"></COL> In marg. edit. Rom.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>iæswû, aJgiwvtate.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>aJgnovtate pavter, basileuð proskunhtev. Prosagoreuvousa
toigarouðn, divkaia aijtwðé× wåste touvtoiû toiðû
pravgmasi qerapeivan hJ uJmetevra galhnovthû ejpitrevyoi
parasceqhðnai× kaiú taú kakwðû pepragmevna diorqwqhðnai</FOREIGN>  
 <NOTE N="6" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0864" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0864D"></COL> In marg. edit. Rom.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>parakeleuvsoi.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>keleuvsoi× aæcriû ouß pavntwn twðn hædh tetupwmevnwn ajnaklhqevntwn,
ejx oJloklhvrou pivstewû, kaiú thðû twðn cristianwðn
qrhskeivaû, hJ kinoumevnh aijtiva, ejn toiðû thðû 1Italivaû
