shú</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="3" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0900" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0900D"></COL> Ms. Ven.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>iJketeuvoû,</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>iJketeuvhé oJsiovthû× diaú toú kaiú thún hJmetevran provqesin,
kaiú toún povqon toiouðton uJpavrcein, wåste pavshû ajsebouðû
 <COL N="0900B"></COL> plavnhû ajpokinhqeivshû, diaú thðû</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="4" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0900" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0900D"></COL> In marg. edit. Cotel.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>sugkothqhsomevnhû sunovdou.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>sugkrothqeivshû tauvthû
sunovdou, souð aujqentouðntoû, megivsth eiúrhvnh periú pavntaû
