4Eti deú gnwvtw hJ shú aJgiovthû, wåû prostavgmati
touð hJmetevrou despovtou kaiú galhnotavtou basilevwû touð
hJmetevrou suzuvgou, eún thðé ejndovxwé povlei thðû Kwnstantinoupovlewû
