 <COL N="0960A"></COL> <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>tevran</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="1" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0960" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0960D"></COL> Sic ambo mss. Ven., astipulante Latino interprete,
