ajdivkwû ejpisteuveto, oåtiper oiJ ceirotonhvsantevû se paraú
touúû kanovnaû touúû aJgivouû</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="2" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1002" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1002D"></COL> Abundat  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>wJû</FOREIGN> ; deinde lege,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>eJautwðn.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>wJû eJautoún oåmoion ejfaivnontov</FOREIGN>  
 <NOTE N="3" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1002" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1002D"></COL> Hoc pronomen superfluit, proindeque delendum.</NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>se ceirotonhvsanteû. 1All1 eæfqasen hJ touð Qeouð ejlehmosuvnh,
 <COL N="1002C"></COL> eijû touðtov se fevrousa kaiú bebaiouðsa, wJû aÞn taiðû
meún kakaiðû ajrcaiðû kalwðû crhvsasqai, kaiú mhú aJnqrwvpwn
krivsei, ajllaú Qeouð ajgaqovthti ceirotonhqhðnai ojfqeivhû× oåper
ajlhqwðû ouåtwû ejstiú dektevon, eij tauvthn thðû qeivaû dwreaðû
thún cavrin eJtevraé mhú ajpolevseiaû proskrouvsei× toún gaúr
kaqolikoún aændra, kaiú mavlista toún touð despovtou iJereva,
wåsper oujdemiaðé plavnhé prosplevkesqai, ouåtwû ouæte tini
