 <NOTE N="3" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1020" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1020D"></COL> <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Diameinavshû.</FOREIGN>  Optimam hanc lectionem ms. Vat.
