twðn prolecqevntwn×</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="3" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1032" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1032C"></COL> Quam implexus corruptusque sit hic locus nemo
 <COL N="1032D"></COL> non videt: sic restituere possis:  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>8Wn uJfhghvsesin wJû
