oJmouð, kaiú didavxai, wåste</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="2" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1036" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1036D"></COL> Leg.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>eij mhú.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>mhú pavnth aujtouúû hJ qeiva filanqrwpiva
