ejkeivnwn uJpotavxai). 8Wn eij kataxiwvshéû</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="6" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1172" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1172D"></COL> Haec vox redundat.</NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejkeivnwn
poihvsasqai thún ajnavgnwsin, oujk aællo khruJttein euJrhvseiû
