uJperevndoxe kaiú sebasteú basileuð, kaq1 oåson oißovnte
høn bracevwû ejfayamevnwn hJmwðn, metaú thðû qeovqen ejmpneusqeivshû
soi pivstewû, kaiú toú par1 hJmwðn khruttovmenon
oJmognwmonouðn</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="7" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1172" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1172D"></COL> Leg.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejpignwvseiû.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejpignwvsei, kaij kataú mhdeún hJmiðn ajpoú
thðû twðn eujaggelivwn kaiú thðû twðn ajpostovlwn didaskalivaû,
hætoi touð sumbovlou thðû kaqolikhðû diafwneiðn oJmologivaû×
 <COL N="1172C"></COL> ejpeidhvper, wJû didavskei oJ makavrioû ajpovstoloû Pauðloû,
Mevga ejstiú toú thðû eujsebeivaû musthvrion, oåper ejfanerwvqh
ejn sarkiú, ejdikaiwvqh ejn pneuvmati, wæfqn toiðû ajggevloiû,
ejkhruvcqh ejn eæqnesin, ejpisteuvqh ejn kovsmwé, ajnelhvfqh ejn
dovxhé.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="1172"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Tiv toigarouðn eæstai lusitelevsteron thðé shðé swthrivaé, tiv
 <COL N="1174A"></COL> thðé shðé ejxousivaé aJrmodiwvteron, <HI REND=BOLD>1382</HI>  hæper iåna thðû eijrhvnhû
twðn touð Qeouð ejkklhsiwðn, taiðû saiðû diatavxesin
poihvshéû thún provnoian, kaiú ejn paðsi toiðû soiðû uJphkovoiû taú
touð Qeouð dwðra ejkdikhvshéû× kaiú mhú ajnavschéû trovpwé tiniú diaú
thðû touð diabovlou baskanivaû calepaivnein eijû oæleqrovn tinwn, 
touúû uJphrevtaû aujtouð× ejf1 wßétev se kataú tovnde toún
